 industry or high-level research laboratories.<br><\/p>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2582704 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2582704\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"http:\/\/dny-filterindo.co.id\/gas%20turbine%20filtration.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Download Product of Gas Turbine<\/u><\/a><\/h6>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f73fdc5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f73fdc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"525\" height=\"769\" src=\"https:\/\/dny-filterindo.co.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/gasturbinefiltration.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/dny-filterindo.co.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/gasturbinefiltration.png 529w, https:\/\/dny-filterindo.co.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/gasturbinefiltration-205x300.png 205w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7fe8e9e0 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-items-stretch elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"7fe8e9e0\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\